My recommendation for the middleware

When you build subscriptionMiddleware.js, its logic should be roughly:

Is user logged in?
        │
        ▼
No → Redirect to login

Yes
        │
        ▼
Is subscriptionStatus === "active"?
        │
        ▼
No → Redirect to subscription/payment page

Yes
        │
        ▼
Has subscriptionExpiredAt passed?
        │
   ┌────┴────┐
   │         │
  Yes       No
   │         │
   ▼         ▼
Mark as     Allow access
expired

This way, the system stays accurate even if a subscription reaches its expiry date while the user is away.

